sat-conformance-title = Check it from the command line.
sat-conformance-text = The server ships a black-box conformance suite: a fake core runs your satellite once per scenario (pairing, refused codes, hello, acknowledgements, audio both ways, reconnection) and names the protocol rule each check proves. Template repositories run it in CI for each language.
